 apps/web/src/components/Sidebar.tsx           |  25 ++--
 .../sidebar/jstackAskOnAdd.browser.test.tsx   | 114 +++++++++++++++++-
 .../src/components/sidebar/jstackAskOnAdd.ts  |  29 +++++
